  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:- ** 1(2)/(3)div(4)/(9)×(p)/(9)=1(1)/(4)×(2)/(3)div(1)/(6)\n\n**To find:- **The value of p\n\nCalculation**:- **It is given that 1(2)/(3)div(4)/(9)×(p)/(9)=1(1)/(4)×(2)/(3)div(1)/(6),\n\nSolving the Left-hand side,\n\n⇒ 1(2)/(3)div(4)/(9)×(p)/(9) = (5)/(3)div(4)/(9)×(p)/(9)\n\n⇒ 1(2)/(3)div(4)/(9)×(p)/(9) = (5)/(3)×(9)/(4)×(p)/(9)\n\n⇒ 1(2)/(3)div(4)/(9)×(p)/(9) = (5p)/(12)\n\nSolving the Right-hand side,\n\n⇒1(1)/(4)×(2)/(3)div(1)/(6) = (5)/(4)×(2)/(3)div(1)/(6)\n\n⇒1(1)/(4)×(2)/(3)div(1)/(6) = (5)/(4)×(2)/(3)×(6)/(1)\n\n⇒1(1)/(4)×(2)/(3)div(1)/(6) = (60)/(12) = 5\n\nEquating the Left-hand side and right-hand side,\n\n⇒(5p)/(12) = 5\n\n⇒ p = 12\n\n**The value of p in the expression is 12**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] __Alternate Method__** 1(2)/(3)div(4)/(9)×(p)/(9)=1(1)/(4)×(2)/(3)div(1)/(6)\n\n⇒** (5)/(3)×(9)/(4)×(p)/(9)=(5)/(4)×(2)/(3)×6**\n\n⇒** **Solving we get, P = 2 × 6 = 12\n\na8:T1198,\n\n&",
